  "name": "Chimichurri Steak Sandwiches with Spicy Fries",
  "subtitle": "Herb-sauced steak rolls with crisp seasoned fries",
  "description": "Seared rump steak, fresh herb chimichurri, and chipotle-lime mayonnaise fill toasted ciabatta rolls alongside Cajun-seasoned fries.",
